  "body": "When a user starts to use a new client that wasn't yet part of his account when an encrypted message was sent, that message is unavailable to this new client.  The same is true when a user signs out and back into his account on a client.  This is not acceptable - encrypted messages can easily become lost and inaccessible this way.\r\n\r\nThere should be a mechanism by which new clients can become eligible to receive the encryption tokens necessary to decrypt old messages.",
